# Static analysis configuration for clang-tidy (used locally and in CI where
# available). Kept intentionally conservative: correctness-focused checks
# first, style noise excluded.
#
# The exclusions below are deliberate, not cleanup debt:
#   - bugprone-branch-clone: the educational demos use parallel branches for
#     readability, and the duplicated bodies are intentional.
#   - bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters: C APIs legitimately take adjacent
#     size/alignment parameters of the same type.
#   - bugprone-implicit-widening-of-multiplication-result: every reported site
#     widens an already-safe size computation; explicit casts only add noise.
#   - bugprone-unchecked-string-to-number-conversion: the Linux-only layout
#     demo/test parse /proc/self/maps best-effort and validate the format.
#   - performance-enum-size: my_strategy's fixed unsigned underlying type is a
#     documented contract (well-defined out-of-range casts), not an accident.
#   - performance-no-int-to-ptr: address-space demos/tests deliberately turn
#     addresses back into pointers to illustrate the layout.
Checks: >
  -*,
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  performance-*,
  portability-*,
  -bugprone-branch-clone,
  -bugprone-easily-swappable-parameters,
  -bugprone-implicit-widening-of-multiplication-result,
  -bugprone-unchecked-string-to-number-conversion,
  -performance-enum-size,
  -performance-no-int-to-ptr
WarningsAsErrors: ''
HeaderFilterRegex: '(include/mymalloc|src/|tests/|examples/)'
FormatStyle: file